    <entry_item>
      <dico>Boberg</dico>
      <unicode>ᠴᠣᠴᠠᠷᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>čučaraqu</uighur>
      <definition>To become cracks in porcelain, ice etc. To crack, to break or burst, to fall to pieces. To become tired or weary.</definition>
      <page>1350</page>
